Q~~">Web Components Sommelier</a>. Like many of Dave=E2=80=99s ideas, it=E2=
=80=99s equal parts joke and brilliance. The idea is a person with deep kno=
wledge of an absolute ton of different Web Components who can suggest ones =
that do just the right thing in any situation. Like a wine sommelier who ca=
n suggest the perfect wine to pair with a meal and meet the diner=E2=80=99s=
 tastes.</p>=0A<p>Need to compare two images=3F <a href=3D"https://go.spark=
