 Need pinch-and-zoom support on any element=3F <a href=3D"https://go.sparkp=
ostmail2.com/f/a/n4jUcifY6Qxv-zqSWHdywQ~~/AABEfhA~/MK1OF3p4RNp_KmVHc-H8L2qt=
olIXG-tji5e11b2fi8_cp3M72Ezk6n6n1ca8ya2iNcgmvCEUUgvzde95KQ4Zl2z3K8XyAL3SCzE=
jiOH5pFWy3607P3o3jhq1ImMl391iBE6gf4DKteqzydGm7CPd3PjAIdOaIx-OnfxHZfE67Ck~">=
Right away</a>, <a href=3D"https://go.sparkpostmail2.com/f/a/JqICUaNF9YJiVk=
